{
	"info": {
		"name": "decidiq-decisions-report-cut",
		"description": "insight-decisions-report-by-period-and-body, task 2 (REQ-DRP-002): OpenRegister's aggregation endpoint counts decisions with a decisionDate gte / lte bound, which is what the Decisions report's period picker sends. Seeds one governance body and five decisions of it (three dated 2025, two dated 2026), counts them with and without a period, groups the 2026 ones by decidingBody (the By body chart), and tears everything down. Every count is scoped to the seeded body, so other decisions on the instance do not change the numbers.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
